WEBVTT

00:08.610 --> 00:12.370
Do you think that even love has a best by date?

00:16.240 --> 00:19.790
For me... it's painful...

00:19.790 --> 00:21.180
Huh?

00:21.460 --> 00:22.800
What was that?

00:22.880 --> 00:23.920
What did you say?

00:24.710 --> 00:29.760
Being near you... is painful...

00:30.130 --> 00:31.010
Huh?

00:33.120 --> 00:37.910
I... like you, Senpai.

00:39.770 --> 00:43.230
My name is Morinaga Tetsuhiro.

00:43.270 --> 00:46.320
I am a 4th year agricultural science student.

00:47.320 --> 00:51.660
And senpai is a second year
agricultural science master's student.

00:52.640 --> 00:56.950
I first landed my sights on Senpai
not long after I first started college.

00:58.850 --> 01:01.270
He was quiet and scholarly,

01:01.270 --> 01:05.770
he had a pretty face and a slim body,

01:05.790 --> 01:07.340
and...

01:07.640 --> 01:08.940
that waist!

01:10.090 --> 01:12.380
But he wasn't really quiet...

01:12.380 --> 01:14.720
he was surly.

01:14.780 --> 01:19.360
And he wasn't really scholarly he was socially inept!

01:19.360 --> 01:22.080
It didn't take me long to find that out.

01:30.820 --> 01:33.320
He's violent and selfish,

01:34.110 --> 01:37.580
and on top of that, he has a horrible brother complex.

01:37.700 --> 01:41.250
He's someone who does what he wants no matter what...

01:41.290 --> 01:45.720
and for some reason, one day, it was with this failure of a human being, Tatsumi Souichi...

01:47.440 --> 01:49.340
that I fell in love with.

01:52.210 --> 01:54.790
Episode 1: Does love have a best by date?

01:56.090 --> 01:57.010
Morinaga!

01:57.720 --> 01:59.930
Se-senpai?

01:59.970 --> 02:02.890
What's wrong? You look upset...

02:03.350 --> 02:05.190
Is that news true?

02:05.230 --> 02:06.830
You'd know, right?

02:06.830 --> 02:07.770
News?

02:07.770 --> 02:09.360
That news! The one from the US!

02:10.480 --> 02:13.490
Ah...! Could you mean from San Francisco...?

02:13.530 --> 02:17.870
That's it! How could they legalize same sex marriage!?

02:17.910 --> 02:19.580
Let me explain,

02:19.580 --> 02:25.830
Not long after entering the 21st century,
San Francisco legalized same sex marriage.

02:25.830 --> 02:27.130
Damn it!

02:27.170 --> 02:30.550
This happened as soon as Tomoe went to the US...

02:32.130 --> 02:37.680
What is it? Are the gays of the world
joining together to pull a prank on me?

02:37.720 --> 02:42.430
No, umm... that's way too much of a persecution complex...

02:42.470 --> 02:48.730
Senpai has no problem saying he's the person who hates gays the most in the world...

02:49.270 --> 02:50.940
All gays have a collective responsibility!

02:50.980 --> 02:51.780
Eh!?

02:51.820 --> 02:55.950
What will you do if Tomoe and Kurokawa say they're getting married...!?

02:57.660 --> 02:58.410
Ouch...

02:59.780 --> 03:04.830
Even if all sorts of miracles were to happen,
I feel like it's impossible for me to ever land him.

03:05.700 --> 03:09.460
Even though I know it will just painful and I should give up already,

03:09.500 --> 03:12.000
my eternal one sided feelings...

03:13.420 --> 03:17.760
that never seem like they'll bear any fruit...

03:17.800 --> 03:21.220
are about to enter their fifth year already...

03:26.230 --> 03:27.600
I can't believe it!

03:28.980 --> 03:31.940
I seriously can't believe it!

03:33.280 --> 03:38.110
I think after 5 years, a one sided love has to have already gone bad!

03:38.150 --> 03:45.370
And on top of that you've been chaste for that senpai and you don't play around at all!

03:45.410 --> 03:49.120
No, it's no like I've been chaste...

03:49.830 --> 03:53.170
Even if you're called Angel-kun,

03:53.210 --> 03:57.470
what will we do if you really end up becoming an angel this way!?

03:58.170 --> 04:02.100
No, I won't become one... so it's fine.

04:02.140 --> 04:07.430
I thought I was already used to how senpai treats me,

04:07.430 --> 04:10.850
but he's been so violent recently. It's a problem...

04:10.900 --> 04:17.110
Ah... that's right. His precious little brother left to be an exchange student, didn't he?

04:17.150 --> 04:22.740
Rather than an exchange student... he got sucked in by a start-up.

04:25.490 --> 04:29.120
Senpai's litter brother, Tatsumi Tomoe-kun,

04:29.160 --> 04:33.210
is smart but also an airhead so he's the type you just can't leave alone...

04:33.250 --> 04:40.590
and of all things he and his male lover... went hand in hand to the US this spring.

04:45.890 --> 04:51.650
Ever since then, his hatred of gays and his prejudices have become even worse

04:52.310 --> 04:56.070
and his criticism of me has been bad too...

04:56.110 --> 04:57.650
You poor thing.

04:59.320 --> 05:04.160
You know, today I have something to give you for that, Angel-kun.

05:04.160 --> 05:04.700
Huh?

05:06.120 --> 05:10.790
Eh? What is it? It's not my birthday or anything...?

05:10.830 --> 05:13.080
It's nothing like that...

05:13.420 --> 05:16.750
It's just me cheering you on, Angel-kun.

05:17.340 --> 05:19.880
Tada~ it's this!

05:21.170 --> 05:23.010
What is it? Alcohol?

05:23.050 --> 05:26.140
That's what the bottle was.
But that's not what's inside!

05:29.180 --> 05:34.020
It's a drug that will make even the most
sexually frigid person all weak in the knees.

05:34.850 --> 05:35.690
Eh!? No way!

05:35.730 --> 05:38.020
I don't need anything like that!

05:38.020 --> 05:43.860
Why!? I felt so bad for you I went and got it specially for you.

05:43.910 --> 05:45.320
This is no joke!!

05:45.370 --> 05:49.580
If I used that on him against his will,
I have no idea what would happen to me after!!

05:49.620 --> 05:52.660
I never said to use it against his will!

05:53.370 --> 05:54.460
What do you mean?

05:55.250 --> 06:05.010
I mean that even though he says he hates gays,
he still relies on you even though he knows your gay, right?

06:06.550 --> 06:12.180
What I think... is that maybe he just can't be honest with himself...

06:12.980 --> 06:17.590
No... I'm sure that's not the case...

06:17.610 --> 06:23.170
This is just the opportunity a love that has been in a stalemate for 5 years needs!

06:20.090 --> 06:24.680
I don't want it! I don't want it, Hiroto-kun!

06:24.740 --> 06:27.780
Come on! Just accept peoples' kindness!

06:32.410 --> 06:35.580
I ended up... taking it with me...

06:37.670 --> 06:40.960
Even if I have this I won't use it!

06:43.300 --> 06:44.930
This tempting thing...

06:46.340 --> 06:51.850
Besides, we don't even know anything about this weird drug! What if it's harmful to the body?

06:53.350 --> 06:55.350
Ah, don't worry about that!

06:55.390 --> 06:57.020
I tried it out myself!

06:57.060 --> 06:58.980
Eh?! Really?

06:59.020 --> 07:00.610
What was it like?

07:01.070 --> 07:03.630
Oh... Come on...

07:03.630 --> 07:05.380
Don't make me say...

07:09.030 --> 07:14.330
Well... I guess there's no reason to throw it away...

07:16.670 --> 07:20.670
But, you know... it's not like I'm going to use it!

07:20.940 --> 07:26.420
So I'll just put it away... back here... at the back of the cabinet...

07:28.340 --> 07:28.940
Gah!

07:29.590 --> 07:32.260
I said I'm just putting it away!!

07:32.530 --> 07:36.790
America

07:42.650 --> 07:43.940
Hello?

07:43.980 --> 07:46.150
...Oh? Nii-san?

07:46.190 --> 07:48.320
You took too long! What were you doing!?

07:48.360 --> 07:53.740
Geez, what are you saying?
It's 5 in the morning here...

07:54.240 --> 07:55.620
What is it?

07:59.420 --> 08:00.460
Who is it?

08:01.460 --> 08:05.760
You aren't all happy about that news are you?!

08:05.800 --> 08:08.470
What news are you talking about?

08:08.510 --> 08:10.430
What do you mean "what news"
the one from San Francisco...

08:10.430 --> 08:12.010
What... you don't know?

08:12.890 --> 08:16.890
Was there some sort of big news in San Fran recently?

08:17.020 --> 08:19.980
Ah... maybe it's that...

08:20.020 --> 08:22.650
They legalized same sex marriage...

08:22.690 --> 08:27.030
Eh...? Th-there was news like that...?

08:27.070 --> 08:28.490
I didn't know.

08:28.530 --> 08:32.450
Well, you've been busy this whole time, Tatsumi-kun.

08:32.490 --> 08:36.790
But... I've been meaning to tell you so this works out.

08:41.240 --> 08:42.830
H-hey!

08:42.830 --> 08:44.750
Will you go with me...

08:44.750 --> 08:45.670
Wait!

08:46.380 --> 08:48.470
to San Francisco sometime soon?

08:49.800 --> 08:51.090
Kurokawa-san!

08:57.970 --> 08:59.680
HEY!!!

09:03.940 --> 09:05.360
Morinaga.

09:06.820 --> 09:11.320
I want to destroy both the US and Kurokawa...

09:11.320 --> 09:12.910
How should I do that?

09:14.870 --> 09:15.490
Senpai?

09:15.470 --> 09:18.700
A death fitting for a country that mass produces gays...!!

09:15.970 --> 09:18.700
Please stop trying to stop an international war!

09:19.040 --> 09:20.710
That bastard, Kurokawa!

09:20.750 --> 09:24.130
He knows that I can't go to the US that easily, so he's doing whatever he wants......!!

09:24.170 --> 09:26.340
That's true! Then let's drink tonight, okay?!

09:26.360 --> 09:29.990
Since this has happened, I'll have
to become the Governor of California...

09:30.030 --> 09:33.450
First I have to get a green card!!!

09:31.570 --> 09:34.450
I'll keep you company the whole time! Okay?

09:35.430 --> 09:38.350
Calm down!!

09:43.650 --> 09:48.360
Ah... Hey! We're out of alcohol!

09:48.400 --> 09:49.440
Already?

09:49.480 --> 09:52.900
No matter how you look at it... you're drinking too fast...

09:52.950 --> 09:53.610
Shut up!

09:55.240 --> 09:57.620
Hurry up and go buy more!

09:58.370 --> 10:00.120
You said you'd keep me company the whole time, right?!

10:01.000 --> 10:02.330
Geez...

10:39.450 --> 10:43.290
Fine, I'll be right back.
But are you going to be okay by yourself?

10:44.040 --> 10:46.500
Yeah... Get snacks too.

10:49.400 --> 10:50.000
Shit...

10:50.760 --> 10:57.970
Senpai has really been...
too careless in front of me recently, hasn't he?

10:58.680 --> 11:00.640
...is he underestimating me?

11:02.310 --> 11:07.940
It's been just about a year since
I blurted out that I was gay and confessed to him.

11:08.730 --> 11:10.940
He didn't give me a response...

11:10.940 --> 11:13.540
But he let things continue as before.

11:13.980 --> 11:15.740
That was good enough...

11:17.530 --> 11:23.700
Of course after I confessed,
he tried to avoid being alone with me...

11:23.750 --> 11:28.880
But recently he seems to have
gotten used to it and given in...

11:31.250 --> 11:34.420
I'm happy he's more relaxed but...

11:34.420 --> 11:39.140
Sometimes it makes me anxious
or maybe pisses me off...

11:39.940 --> 11:49.020
Hey, Senpai... do you actually
remember how it is I see you...?

11:55.900 --> 11:59.700
Damn it! There isn't even a drop left...

12:02.080 --> 12:03.990
That Tomoe...

12:06.540 --> 12:10.250
He's been completely taken in
by Kurokawa's stupidity...

12:14.140 --> 12:15.630
Back then...

12:20.390 --> 12:23.470
He was talking in his sleep... It was a bad joke...

12:23.930 --> 12:26.730
It was just a fever dream...

12:28.230 --> 12:29.440
I like you.

12:40.570 --> 12:43.830
I just don't get why have you gone over that side!

12:44.280 --> 12:45.240
Huh?

12:46.380 --> 12:48.840
I'm asking why you're so unconcerned about it!!

12:49.120 --> 12:53.130
I mean, weren't you against it to begin with!?

12:53.170 --> 12:56.030
So how is it that you have no problem with it now?

12:56.030 --> 12:59.860
It's not like... I have no problem with it...

12:59.900 --> 13:03.070
At first it really hurt...

13:05.350 --> 13:08.560
Ah! But then when we used vaseline it was actually pretty...

13:10.730 --> 13:12.600
I'll kill Kurokawa!

13:12.600 --> 13:13.940
Wait, wait, wait!!

13:13.940 --> 13:17.820
HOW!?! How can you do something so
against the preservation of the species!?!

13:17.860 --> 13:20.820
It's wrong, you know? It goes against humanity!!

13:20.860 --> 13:24.030
Well the birth rate probably will go down...

13:24.070 --> 13:26.450
That's not what I mean!

13:29.330 --> 13:31.670
Umm... Nii-san?

13:31.670 --> 13:33.080
Why?

13:35.090 --> 13:38.460
If you want to be intimate with him, I won't stop you.

13:40.590 --> 13:43.090
But you couldn't have just had a normal relationship?

13:43.130 --> 13:45.930
It has to be like that?

13:49.770 --> 13:53.730
...Honestly, I probably would
have been fine either way.

13:54.600 --> 13:55.940
Then why...?

13:55.980 --> 13:58.280
But Kurokawa-san is different.

13:58.320 --> 13:59.610
You...

13:59.650 --> 14:03.570
Because I like Kurokawa-san,

14:03.570 --> 14:08.370
I thought about it really seriously,
and there were things I figured out from that.

14:09.790 --> 14:14.540
And now there are a lot of times I'm glad we became like this.

14:14.580 --> 14:18.750
So I think this is actually good...

14:21.050 --> 14:24.130
You're just confusing feelings of friendship and love!

14:24.880 --> 14:27.050
I don't think I am...

14:27.100 --> 14:28.260
You are!!

14:29.140 --> 14:30.810
...I wouldn't be able to do that...

14:31.310 --> 14:33.140
Eh...? What?

14:35.600 --> 14:39.690
Umm... I'm happy that you're listening to me but...

14:40.530 --> 14:44.200
Aren't you being a little weird right now, Nii-san?

14:44.240 --> 14:46.070
Did something happen?

14:51.080 --> 14:54.500
He's taking so long... That bastard...

14:54.540 --> 14:58.920
Doesn't he have at least one bottle hidden somewhere...

15:04.720 --> 15:09.450
Huh? What is this?
It pisses me off. It's yellow!

15:09.470 --> 15:11.240
It's super yellow!

15:09.780 --> 15:12.160
Completely drunk

15:13.680 --> 15:14.260
Hmm?

15:14.420 --> 15:14.980
Oh!

15:15.400 --> 15:17.140
Ooh!

15:17.400 --> 15:19.690
What, he does have some!

15:19.940 --> 15:23.610
That asshole, hiding it down there.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.490
Let's see.

15:33.750 --> 15:36.710
Huh...? It's not that good...

15:37.830 --> 15:39.210
I'm back!

15:39.250 --> 15:41.540
Senpai, I bought the stuff.

15:42.170 --> 15:43.920
Oh! Thanks.

15:48.680 --> 15:50.970
What happened here!?

15:51.600 --> 15:52.540
Huh?

15:53.270 --> 15:54.160
Don't blame me.

15:54.350 --> 15:58.850
You took too long so
I just went searching for alcohol!

15:58.900 --> 16:00.690
If I did have any I would have gotten it out!?

16:00.730 --> 16:04.070
Geez... I got everything out of the cabinet...

16:04.110 --> 16:05.110
Liar!

16:05.150 --> 16:07.740
See! I found some.

16:10.900 --> 16:11.680
Huh?

16:13.320 --> 16:13.800
Eh!?

16:18.870 --> 16:21.210
Senpai!
Did you drink this?

16:21.250 --> 16:23.250
Did you drink this!?!

16:23.250 --> 16:26.800
What? Was it that precious of alcohol?

16:26.840 --> 16:30.050
It didn't really taste good.

16:30.720 --> 16:33.010
Maybe it wasn't preserved well?

16:33.890 --> 16:37.880
Umm...Your... body doesn't feel weird...?

16:38.080 --> 16:39.100
You're feeling okay...?

16:39.100 --> 16:39.980
Huh?

16:42.190 --> 16:43.440
What do you mean...?

16:44.150 --> 16:49.740
Huh...? Could it be...
Hiroto-kun tricked me?

16:49.780 --> 16:51.990
Now let's start drinking again!

17:16.810 --> 17:20.230
I really... drank too much, didn't I...?

17:21.810 --> 17:22.900
Water...

17:26.460 --> 17:27.560
Huh...?

17:28.100 --> 17:30.490
This is... weird?

17:30.530 --> 17:32.900
Even though I drank that much...

17:33.240 --> 17:35.540
Why am I feeling like this...?

17:41.670 --> 17:45.130
It would definitely be bad
If he found out about this...

17:45.170 --> 17:47.210
Guess it can't be helped...
I'll go to the bathroom..

17:54.700 --> 17:56.600
Huh? What?

17:59.520 --> 18:00.640
Senpai!

18:02.390 --> 18:04.310
What's wrong?

18:06.060 --> 18:07.730
Are you okay?

18:07.730 --> 18:09.650
What is this...?!

18:09.690 --> 18:11.780
I can't...Move my body...!

18:15.700 --> 18:20.250
It's nothing... I was just trying to go to the toilet...

18:21.370 --> 18:27.210
Geez, I guess it can't be helped...
You really drank too much.

18:27.250 --> 18:29.340
Come on, hold on to me

18:30.170 --> 18:31.840
Ah! No...

18:32.670 --> 18:33.590
It's fine.

18:33.630 --> 18:37.760
I can go to the toilet... By myself...!

18:37.800 --> 18:40.520
Eh? Why are you being so stubborn?

18:40.560 --> 18:42.100
Come on, lean on me.

18:42.140 --> 18:45.020
I said I was fine!!

18:45.060 --> 18:46.190
Crap!

18:50.320 --> 18:57.700
Uhh... and... Could you maybe...
go buy some medicine...? Like stomach medicine...?

18:57.700 --> 19:01.450
Do you feel like you're going to throw up? I have some here.

19:02.460 --> 19:05.750
Ah.. and I just ran out of cigarettes...

19:06.830 --> 19:10.420
I just bought a carton of them when I bought the alcohol though...?

19:11.210 --> 19:13.340
This... over-attentive guy...!

19:13.380 --> 19:17.430
Then just 30 minutes is fine, so go take a walk around the neighborhood!!

19:17.470 --> 19:22.680
Huh!? Why do I have to go take a walk in the middle of the night!?

19:22.720 --> 19:26.520
Come on, I won't listen to your drunken nonsense anymore!

19:26.560 --> 19:29.360
Please don't throw up on the futon!

19:29.360 --> 19:31.860
Come on, stand... up...

19:35.200 --> 19:38.490
Come on! Please stand up properly!!

19:38.530 --> 19:42.080
Even if you say so... My legs have no strength...

19:42.120 --> 19:44.540
Come on, get up already...

19:44.740 --> 19:45.960
Ah!

19:48.750 --> 19:50.670
Umm... Senpai?

19:52.250 --> 19:55.380
Hurry and get me up! I can't stand!!

19:56.220 --> 19:59.340
This thing touching my leg... is...!

20:05.390 --> 20:06.600
You're... You're rock hard!

20:06.640 --> 20:09.310
Don't say "rock hard"!!

20:08.240 --> 20:13.420
It's not like I have any control over it...
It's like people say, it has a mind of its own!

20:09.460 --> 20:13.090
S-so this means THAT...

20:14.320 --> 20:16.570
That drug actually worked!?

20:16.610 --> 20:20.240
I'll just take care of it myself,
so take me to the toilet...!!

20:20.280 --> 20:22.430
It... It was real!?!

20:22.430 --> 20:23.680
By yourself...?

20:23.700 --> 20:24.910
What will I do!?

20:24.950 --> 20:29.020
But you don't have any strength in your arms or legs...

20:29.020 --> 20:30.960
Would you be able to...?

20:30.960 --> 20:32.500
An opportunity like this...

20:33.640 --> 20:35.900
Will never happen again...

20:36.520 --> 20:37.300
Umm...

20:39.240 --> 20:40.280
I...

20:41.300 --> 20:43.010
Hey, Morinaga!

20:43.050 --> 20:46.310
Could it be that you...

20:47.930 --> 20:50.650
Actually drugged ME...?

20:52.310 --> 20:54.270
You bastard! You did, didn't you!?!

20:54.320 --> 20:57.150
No... That's-... That's not it!! It's... not...?

20:59.520 --> 21:00.200
Ah?

21:01.820 --> 21:04.370
Senpai's... so cute...

21:05.350 --> 21:07.060
You bastard!

21:06.770 --> 21:07.890
Attack power

21:08.180 --> 21:09.270
95% down

21:10.420 --> 21:14.840
I thought this was weird for just being drunk...

21:15.550 --> 21:18.210
I'll make you regret even being born!

21:18.260 --> 21:20.010
So don't move!

21:20.050 --> 21:23.140
Don't blame me! You drank it on your own, Senpai!

21:23.180 --> 21:24.140
Huh!?

21:24.180 --> 21:27.280
It's this! Even though I had it stored at the back of the cabinet!!

21:27.300 --> 21:29.220
Geh!?

21:29.480 --> 21:32.690
Y-you're in the wrong for rummaging around someone's place without permission!!

21:32.730 --> 21:34.230
W-what are you talking about?!

21:34.270 --> 21:36.900
You're the one in the wrong for having something like that!

21:37.030 --> 21:41.780
Th-... that's because... my friend
pretty much forced it on me!

21:41.820 --> 21:43.320
Don't blame this on someone else!!

21:43.370 --> 21:47.080
The fact that you didn't throw it away means that you planned to use it someday, didn't you!!

21:47.120 --> 21:51.160
But! It's not like I planned to use it on you, Senpai...

21:51.210 --> 21:55.750
Hmm! Then that means you were planning to use it on someone besides me?

21:55.790 --> 21:57.130
You're so unfaithful!

21:57.130 --> 21:59.180
Homos really are just animals!!

21:59.180 --> 22:01.180
Animal, animal!

22:00.160 --> 22:02.430
I can't even win in a verbal argument......

22:03.320 --> 22:04.430
Oww...

22:06.550 --> 22:10.230
Senpai... you should try
to do something about that...

22:10.270 --> 22:12.640
Shut up! I know!

22:14.980 --> 22:17.670
